   Dzhambov, Angel M.; Burov, Angel; Markevych, Iana; Kostadinov, Kostadin R.; Dimitrova, Donka; Helbich, Marco, Med Univ Plovdiv, Strateg Res \& Innovat Program Dev, Hlth \& Qual Life Green \& Sustainable Environm Res, Plovdiv, Bulgaria.
